[71.01242, "o", "nager wanted to make sure'\r\nb'you saw this first-day note and know who to contact as you get settled.'\r\nb''\r\nb'A few helpful first steps:'\r\nb'  1. Reply to this email to say hello to Avery Manager.'\r\nb'  2. Check your calendar for your onboarding sessions and team introductions.'\r\nb\"  3. Keep this message handy for quick access to your manager's contact detai=\"\r\nb'ls.'\r\nb''\r\nb'If anything looks missing or confusing, just reply here and Avery Manager will'\r\nb'help point you in the right direction.'\r\nb''\r\nb\"We're glad you're here!\"\r\nb''\r\nb'Avery Manager'\r\nb'manager@example.com'\r\n------------ END MESSAGE ------------\r\n---------- MESSAGE FOLLOWS ----------\r\nb'From: noreply@system.internal.example'\r\nb'To: admin@system.internal.example'\r\nb'Subject: System Notice: Routine Health Check'\r\nb'Content-Type: text/plain; charset=\"utf-8\"'\r\nb'Content-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit'\r\nb'MIME-Version: 1.0'\r\nb'X-Peer: 127.0.0.1'\r\nb''\r\nb'All internal deployment and monitoring services operational.'\r\n------------ END MESSAGE ------------"]
